# Liberty orchestration

Read `docs/ORCHESTRATION.md` and `docs/agent_handoffs/ACTIVE.md` at session start.

## Budget and scope

- Cursor Pro only. No Devin. No pay-as-you-go. Prefer Composer/Auto; avoid parallel `/orchestrate` cloud workers.
- One bounded slice per session. Use in-session subagents, not extra Cloud Agent VMs.
- Repository truth beats chat. Report Proven / Inferred / Unknown.

## Gates (ask Scott first)

- `schema.sql` changes
- Feature flags False → True
- Production ball detector settings (`models/ball_detector.pt`, `ball_confidence`)

## Workflow

- Branch: `cursor/<descriptive-name>-ac1f` off `jason-5-may-updates`
- Update `docs/agent_handoffs/ACTIVE.md` when task completes; archive to `ARCHIVE/`
- PR for code changes; no GitHub label coordination
